			<div class="content" id="post-content-4116421">
									

<p>So here's my entry into the 2019 Cliché Contest! Many thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cyantreuse" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2303803); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2303803&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1547259594" alt="Cyantreuse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2303803)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cyantreuse" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2303803); return false;">Cyantreuse</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3938622); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3938622&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1547259594" alt="The Great Hippo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3938622)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3938622); return false;">The Great Hippo</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fieldstone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1436137); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1436137&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1547259594" alt="fieldstone" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1436137)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fieldstone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1436137); return false;">fieldstone</a></span> for crit and encouragement.</p>
<p>Clichés I used for the contest:</p>
<ul>
<li>Spooky scary murder monster!</li>
<li>An interview in which the anomaly is overly cryptic, followed by the interviewer suffering.</li>
</ul>
<p>With sort of a half-entry into the &quot;A highly skilled Mobile Task Force gets steamrolled&quot; category.</p>
<p>Photos used are:</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/frosch50/14484286130" target="_blank">sewing</a> by Georgie Pauwels (released under CC-BY 2.0)</li>
<li><a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/rod_waddington/16766897893" target="_blank">Stone Town, Zanzibar</a> by Rod Waddington (released under CC-BY-SA 2.0)</li>
</ul>

